    "title": "STRIKE UP THE BAND",
    "text": "Thursday, August 28, 2025\nThe Jamestown Community Band, under the director of Don Smith, performs Sunday during the finale of the recreation department’s free summer concert series. The band, founded in 1993 by Dr. Joe England to march in the Memorial Day parade, traditionally culminates the series. PHOTO BY ANDREA VON HOHENLEITEN",
